stateDiagram-v2
    %% Feature lifecycle — implementation authority:
    %% corebase-specharness/project/state-machine.yaml and WORKFLOW.md §9

    [*] --> Researching: /spec-research
    [*] --> Specifying: /spec-requirements without research

    Researching --> ResearchComplete: analysis.md complete
    ResearchComplete --> Specifying: /spec-requirements

    Specifying --> NeedsClarification: decision or information missing
    NeedsClarification --> Specifying: clarification resolved
    Specifying --> SpecApproved: requirements verification passes

    SpecApproved --> Planning: /spec-plan
    Planning --> TaskPlanning: plan.md ready and spec-tasks
    TaskPlanning --> PlanApproved: task graph and traceability ready

    PlanApproved --> Implementing: /spec-implement
    Implementing --> Blocked: external dependency or named blocker
    Blocked --> Implementing: blocker resolved
    Blocked --> Specifying: rethink requirements
    Blocked --> Planning: rethink technical design
    Blocked --> Verifying: re-verify after unblock
    Blocked --> Abandoned: explicit human decision

    Implementing --> Replanning: design or task graph gap
    Replanning --> Planning: revise technical plan
    Replanning --> TaskPlanning: rebuild task graph
    Replanning --> Blocked: dependency discovery

    Implementing --> Planning: design gap
    Implementing --> Specifying: spec gap
    Implementing --> Verifying: all tasks done with evidence and harness-verify

    Verifying --> ChangesRequested: verification finding
    ChangesRequested --> Implementing: reopen tasks and fix
    ChangesRequested --> Planning: design gap
    ChangesRequested --> Replanning: replan tasks
    ChangesRequested --> Abandoned: explicit human decision

    Verifying --> Planning: structural or design gap
    Verifying --> Implementing: implementation defect
    Verifying --> Blocked: verification blocker
    Verifying --> Done: verified is true plus Post-Ship Sync

    Researching --> Blocked: research blocker
    ResearchComplete --> Blocked: handoff blocker
    Specifying --> Blocked: requirement blocker
    SpecApproved --> Blocked: plan handoff blocker
    Planning --> Blocked: design blocker
    TaskPlanning --> Blocked: breakdown blocker
    PlanApproved --> Blocked: implement handoff blocker

    Researching --> Abandoned: explicit human decision
    ResearchComplete --> Abandoned: explicit human decision
    Specifying --> Abandoned: explicit human decision
    NeedsClarification --> Abandoned: explicit human decision
    SpecApproved --> Abandoned: explicit human decision
    Planning --> Abandoned: explicit human decision
    TaskPlanning --> Abandoned: explicit human decision
    PlanApproved --> Abandoned: explicit human decision
    Replanning --> Abandoned: explicit human decision
    Implementing --> Abandoned: explicit human decision
    Verifying --> Abandoned: explicit human decision

    Done --> [*]
    Abandoned --> [*]

    note right of Verifying
        check_readiness, artifact-check --trace,
        confirmed gates, and review provider.
        Advisory mode exits 0 with verified=false
        and does NOT authorize Done.
    end note

    note right of Done
        harness-verify is the sole Done authority.
        Requires inline verification pass AND
        ## Post-Ship Sync in session-extracts.md.
    end note
